          "text": "[[EV_008]]"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "EMPLOYEE",
          "text": "[[EV_009]] [[EV_012]] On the work side, have you managed to make your schedule a bit quieter yet?"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "CLIENT",
          "text": "A little bit. My brother is taking more of the daily calls, and the office team handles the routine paperwork. I'm trying not to go in every Saturday. Still getting used to leaving things with them, lah."
        },
        {
